@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

start
:Package bytes + trustedKeys + revokedKeyIds\n+ host inputs + verifyBytecode callback;
:1. Exact package/payload schema, supported versions;
:2. Canonical payload digest,\n>= 1 active trusted signature;
:3. Compiler revision, runtime semantics,\nruntime ABI, binding revision;
:4. Manifest format, required capabilities\nvs host inputs;
:5. Source / GFB / manifest / source-map\ndigests and cross-links;
:6. Source-trace metadata vs\nsource and GFB identities;
:7. Host verifyBytecode(GFB, frozen manifest,\nsource map, identity);
if (Every check passed and\ncallback returned exactly true?) then (yes)
  :Verified result\n(bytecode.copy() on each access);
else (no)
  :PortablePackageError with stable code\n(no bytecode exposed, no fallback);
endif
stop
@enduml
